{"id":"gas","lemma":"gas","pos":"noun","rank":1298,"glosses":["gas (matter between liquid and plasma)","gas (an element or compound in such a state)","gas (flammable gas used for combustion)"],"ipa":"/ˈɡas/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"gases"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-gas.wav","examples":[{"text":"Encienda usted el gas.","en":"Turn on the gas.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586880"},{"text":"El aire es una mezcla de varios gases.","en":"Air is a mixture of several gases.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684548"},{"text":"Tomás cocina con gas.","en":"Tom cooks with gas.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501547"},{"text":"El aire es una mezcla invisible de gases.","en":"Air is a mixture of gases that we can't see."},{"text":"Este calentador funciona con gas.","en":"This heater burns gas.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461109"}]}